{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":303773,"duration_api_ms":326628,"num_turns":14,"result":"The habitat registry implementation is **approved**. All four acceptance criteria are met with strong test coverage (33 habitat tests + 13 plant/algae + 13 scenario tests all passing, clippy clean). The one save_load test failure is a pre-existing RNG serialization issue unrelated to this work.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"e728d454-e6c6-4bdd-af2a-e55ca4592bf0","total_cost_usd":1.1156505499999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":68639,"cache_read_input_tokens":339256,"output_tokens":6158,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":68639,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5305,"outputTokens":14164,"cacheReadInputTokens":1768238,"cacheCreationInputTokens":88076,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.3630438,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":7,"outputTokens":6158,"cacheReadInputTokens":339256,"cacheCreationInputTokens":68639,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.75260675,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["All 4 acceptance criteria satisfied: (1) HabitatKind enum (5 variants: FilterMedia, GlassHardscape, PlantSurfaces, SubstrateSurface, SubstrateDeep) and HabitatEntry struct are serde-serializable with documented purpose and minimal metadata (area + 3 exposure modifiers). (2) Colonizable areas are derived from live state — filter from hardware.media_area_cm2, glass from wall_area+hardscape, plants from biomass×SLA per guild, substrate surface from footprint gated on depth>0, substrate deep from footprint×depth×kind.colonizable_area_factor(). (3) All three modifiers (flow, oxygen, light) are documented, clamped to [0,1] at construction (habitat.rs:130-132), and respond to scenario inputs: filter flow/clogging, aeration, light intensity, plant crowding, water depth attenuation via water_depth_above_substrate_cm(), rooted plant aerenchyma. (4) 33 dedicated habitat_registry tests cover serialization round-trips (3), area computation for all 5 habitats including edge cases (8+), modifier sensitivity (9), bounds under extreme inputs (1), biomass responsiveness (2+), registry freshness after trim/light/daily actions (4+), and structure/geometry invariants (4).","Habitat registry tests: `cargo test -p tank_core --test habitat_registry` — 33 passed, 0 failed.","Plant/algae integration tests: `cargo test -p tank_core --test plant_algae_integration` — 13 passed, 0 failed.","Scenario tests: `cargo test -p tank_scenarios` — 9 materialization + 4 startup_overrides = 13 passed, 0 failed.","Clippy clean: `cargo clippy -p tank_core -p tank_scenarios` — no warnings on habitat-relevant crates.","ChangePhotoperiod correctly excluded from affects_habitat_registry() (actions.rs:159-168). Dedicated test `photoperiod_action_does_not_mark_habitat_registry_dirty` guards this.","Daily dual-refresh pattern documented in engine.rs: first refresh after plant/algae daily steps for plant-driven surfaces, second refresh after filter clogging updates for FilterMedia oxygen exposure.","Legacy hardscape omission documented at both the function definition (biology.rs:662-666) and the call site (algae_growth.rs:173-174), both referencing tanksim-6e5.5.3 as the migration target.","refresh_habitat_registry() (state.rs:240-252) recomputes plant crowding from live biomass via derived_plant_crowding_index(), materializes resolved colonizable_area_factor per substrate layer, derives colonizable_area_cm2 from current footprint, then rebuilds the full registry.","SubstrateLayerState::derived_colonizable_area_cm2() correctly uses footprint × depth × factor (substrate.rs:54-58). resolved_colonizable_area_factor() falls back to kind default for legacy/zero values (substrate.rs:44-49). SubstrateLayerState::default() initializes from TankGeometry::default()."],"findings_or_gaps":["save_load_with_active_cycle_state test fails (1 of 31 save_load tests). Investigation confirms this is a PRE-EXISTING RNG serialization issue, not caused by the habitat registry work. The ChaCha8Rng BlockRng index diverges (64 vs 0) after save/load because set_word_pos() during deserialization doesn't perfectly restore the internal buffer state. refresh_habitat_registry() is called on a cloned state during save and does not interact with the RNG at all. The tiny floating-point chemistry divergence (e.g., ammonia 37.3214 vs 37.3212) is a downstream symptom of the RNG state mismatch, not a habitat registry bug.","Minor redundancy: derived_plant_crowding_index() is called twice during a single refresh cycle — once in refresh_habitat_registry() to update plant guild fields (state.rs:241), and again inside compute_habitat_registry() for the HabitatEnv (habitat.rs:103). Both produce the same value; passing the pre-computed value would eliminate one traversal but has no correctness impact.","SubstrateKind::colonizable_area_factor() values (0.5–0.9) are code-level constants that must stay aligned with the substrate preset pack. No mechanism enforces this alignment automatically — noted as a known outstanding risk from prior stages."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["The pre-existing save_load_with_active_cycle_state RNG determinism failure should be tracked and fixed separately from this task. The root cause is in SimRng::from_repr() (rng.rs) where set_word_pos(draws * 2) may not correctly restore ChaCha8Rng's internal BlockRng buffer state. Consider serializing the full RNG state or adjusting the word-position restoration logic."]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"ce6aba3b-ba30-49b3-9260-7baa511facda"}
